The [[Snowball]] is an epic [[accessory]] attained in a pair by buying the [[Wonky Snowman]] from the shop. It inflicts some {{icon/cold}} at start of battle and makes your opponent gain less maximum health for the entire battle. It can be crafted into various {{icon/cold}}-related [[weapon]]s, [[armor]], and [[shield]]s.
